// Raft scenario "commit": election timeouts, in steps of silence, a 9 (the first leader does not compete again
// within the bound), b 3, c 4; the client submits "x" to a at time 2, "y" to b at time 6 and "y" to c at time 8.
// When a's messages stop reaching a follower, that follower can become the leader of term 2 and append "y" at the
// index where a appended "x". Blossom golden corpus, re-derived (derived = true); see ../../README.md.

patience("a", 9)@1;
patience("b", 3)@1;
patience("c", 4)@1;

submit("a", "x")@2;
submit("b", "y")@6;
submit("c", "y")@8;
